            bundle</li>
            <li><a href={url('/app/configure-the-app')}>Config</a> — the schema the start form
            reads</li>
            <li><a href={url('/reference/cli')}>CLI</a> — every command and flag</li>
        </ul>
    </Section>
</Doc>
